        <mxCell id="note" value="Progressive disclosure: most apps use concrete types only (IPv4Address, IPNetwork, …). Public protocols are the next layer—for generic algorithms and shared ops—not day-one vocabulary. See DESIGN.md §3 and §6." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
